ic survey had Scott up ten, but an early-October State Navigate poll showed a narrower three-point lead and UNH's September survey put Janoo ahead by six. Prediction markets converge on roughly a 70% chance for Scott. Janoo has gained visibility with endorsements from Bernie Sanders and Ro Khanna, but Scott's crossover appeal keeps him favored in a race that could tighten.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.2101, "margin": -4.77}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0165, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0219, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0312, "margin": -10.8}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.2344, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2363, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2599, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2631, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.2569, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.1727, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.1689, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.1678, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.1704, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.2792, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.2255, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.1487, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2939, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.2369, "margin": -4.0}]}